		<h1 style="color: white; font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px;">Case K-AI</h1>
			
		<p style="color: white;">The artificial intelligence team at K-group does a great job building intelligence in every industry that the corporation operates in. The highly professional team needed help to establish a clear brand to gain better exposure for the important work they do.
		</p>	

		<p style="color: white;"><strong>Roles</strong>: Designer & Front End Developer<br>
		<strong>Time</strong>: 2017<br>
		<strong>Tools:</strong></p>



